window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Taste Of Revenge Is Nothing Compared To The Taste Of Him…</p> <p>Dante Villani is every bit his name…a raging, blazing inferno who consumes everything in his path.</p> <p>He’s dark, dangerous, and delicious….a sexy as hell contract killer for the powerful and ruthless Villani family.</p> <p>And the man I was sent to destroy.</p> <p>Not that I knew it when he had me pinned up against the wall of that nightclub with his sinful body and electric touch.</p> <p>A second chance encounter with my forbidden target has me obsessed…and hungry for more of his devious tongue and savage hands.</p> <p>My hatred for what he did to my family runs deep, but my growing desire for Dante blurs the line between love and loyalty.</p> <p>I’m drowning in pent-up desire with no lifeline in sight.</p> <p>But the course is set.</p> <p>He must die.</p> <p>Unless my insta-lust kills me first.</p> <p>SAVAGE SINNER is the fourth and final book in the SINFULLY SAVAGE series by USA Today Bestselling Author Kristen Luciani. Be prepared for jaw-dropping twists and holy %$#@*&amp; moments! This Dark Mafia Second Chance Forbidden Romance is a standalone suspense novel, complete with a guaranteed HEA and no cliffhangers. Ready to lose yourself in the deliciously deviant and savage underworld starring the Villani family? Then scroll up and one click to start binge listening to this complete series today!</p> <p>CAUTION: Blazing hot bedroom scenes with a little bit of kink are intended for mature listeners only!</p>"; 
